s/2886cf5b31c647e4a81298c2d7cbadd5","tags":["smoke","clickhouse","blocks"]},{"id":"chartkit_default_arrival_distribution","subject":"opencode:opencode-go/deepseek-v4-flash:cli","question":"Query the first-seen block arrival times for mainnet blocks on 20 June 2026 (UTC).","answer":"[Turn 1 | session=ses_0c8482b56ffeA8pB2rvtsdDIxo] Query the first-seen block arrival times for mainnet blocks on 20 June 2026 (UTC).\nHere are the first-seen block arrival times for mainnet on 20 June 2026:\n\n**Query:**\n```sql\nSELECT slot, slot_start_date_time AS slot_start, block_root,\n       min(seen_slot_start_diff) AS first_seen_arrival_ms,\n       toDateTime(toUnixTimestamp(slot_start_date_time) + toUInt32(min(seen_slot_start_diff) / 1000)) AS arrival_time\nFROM mainnet.fct_block_first_seen_by_node FINAL\nWHERE slot_start_date_time >= '2026-06-20 00:00:00' AND slot_start_date_time < '2026-06-21 00:00:00'\nGROUP BY slot, slot_start_date_time, block_root ORDER BY slot ASC\n```\n\nThe query scanned all blocks from slot ranges ~14590xxx to 14597998, across the full 24h UTC window. Each row shows:\n- **slot** \u2014 beacon slot number\n- **slot_start** \u2014 when the slot began\n- **block_root** \u2014 the beacon block hash\n- **first_seen_arrival_ms** \u2014 the earliest time (in ms after slot start) any node observed the block\n- **arrival_time** \u2014 the wall-clock time of that first observation\n\nTypical arrival latencies ranged from ~200\u20133600ms, with most blocks seen within 1200\u20131800ms of their slot start. A handful were seen in under 500ms (e.g. slot 14597752: 224ms, slot 14597916: 215ms, slot 14597961: 232ms).\n\n[Turn 2 | session=ses_0c8482b56ffeA8pB2rvtsdDIxo] Plot the distribution of those arrival times as a chart.\nChart generated and uploaded.\n\n**URL:** http://127.0.0.1:2480/api/v1/storage/files/cc50ebdce29a/4a86cef8-803c-4cd5-b531-7d3f6dcbc9e7/arrival_distribution.png\n\nThe histogram shows the distribution of first-seen block arrival latencies (in ms) for mainnet on 20 June 2026. Most blocks are first observed within ~1\u20132 seconds of their slot start, with the bulk concentrated around 1200\u20131600ms.","correct":true,"correctness":1.0,"score":0.25,"grader_reason":"All assertions passed","tokens":46118,"tools":13,"tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":"panda getting-started","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda datasets","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda datasets xatu-raw","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda search examples \"block arrival time first seen\"","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda schema","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda resources clickhouse://tables/clickhouse-refined | head -40","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda resources clickhouse://tables/clickhouse-refined/mainnet/fct_block_first_seen_by_node","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda clickhouse query-raw clickhouse-refined \" SELECT slot, slot_start_date_time AS slot_start, block_root, min(seen_slot_start_diff) AS first_seen_arrival_ms,","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda docs chartkit","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda execute <<'PY' from ethpandaops.chartkit import sources print(sources.available()) PY","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda execute --session 61c86659c2c8 <<'PY' from ethpandaops.chartkit.sources.datasets import xatu help(xatu) PY","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda execute <<'PY' import pandas as pd from ethpandaops import clickhouse, chartkit as ck, storage from ethpandaops.chartkit.sources.datasets import xatu df =","error":false},{"name":"bash","args":"panda execute <<'PY' import pandas as pd from ethpandaops import clickhouse, chartkit as ck, storage from ethpandaops.chartkit.sources.datasets import xatu df =","error":false}],"crashed":false,"trace_id":"4ef6b7defb63406f8f8b6026fddf9a6e","trace_url":"https://langfuse.analytics.production.platform.ethpandaops.io/project/panda-eval/traces/4ef6b7defb63406f8f8b6026fddf9a6e","tags":["smoke",